    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to believe that \"rest\" can be anything more than just... nothingness. like, if i actually stop the noise, i'm not just resting, i'm just gone. is that what you mean? that there's a kind of peace in finally just letting go of the struggle entirely?",
